      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把“最后”两字的意义看得很重的训练员，\n决定将荣进闪耀奔跑的身影\n烙印在眼底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe62c4b9c4ed9e966d37ea3b021d0a0884c0e465f48ac57f24087dc5c58efd82",
