      "uid": "zhcn:4f505ffd1498f5e735cdf9f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并大胆地向她们宣战。\n这突如其来的举动，\n是源自于她对一决胜负的期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1b37b7138ecef72f370887aa0f1f36ab5b287ea4c0ac879f479108fbdb2ce8",
