      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于迎来了“天皇赏（秋）”。\n在父母的守候下，荣进闪耀要求训练员\n也待在观众席观看比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64cae49019a7a335b5c3f98ea2f8932f2a64ec9306aee4c0aa386968ec6193ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
