      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在欢声雷动中，荣进闪耀回想至今的一切。\n像是追求“正道”的契机，\n以及在追求的路途中──",
      "source_fingerprint": "94823c1037bd8147957fe632b6f27e36da5db1876fe72580c6b082c6fce24463",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1037/storytimeline_501037419.json",
